  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Offentlig finansiell styrning - FINMAP</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Financial Management - FINMAP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FINMAP provides support to public financial management reform in      Uganda. Sweden contributes to a basket fund together with five other  donors namely Ireland, European Union, German Development Bank(KfW),  UK (DFID)and Norway. A Memorandum of Understanding between partners   and government was signed in November 2011. The programme has six     components spanning central and local government institutions.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Planerat st&#xf6;d till reform av offentlig finansiell styrning i Uganda.  Sverige bidrar genom en s k basket fund tillsammans med andra givare. Ett s k Memoramdum of Understanding planeras att uppr&#xe4;ttats mellan    givare och den ugandiska regeringen. Programmet har sex (?)           komponenter som inkluderar institutioner p&#xe5; b&#xe5;de central och lokal    niv&#xe5;.(uppdateras)</narrative>
  </description>
